<title>USA: Newburyport, Mass., won by State Street Bank.</title>
<headline>Newburyport, Mass., won by State Street Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Street Bank and Trust Company of Boston said it won $5.020 million of Newburyport, Mass., municipal purpose loan of 1996 bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.0652 percent.</p>
<p>AMT: 5,020,000	DATE: 12/04/96	NYC Time: 1100	CUSIP: 651027	</p>
<p>ISSUER: Newburyport						     ST: MA		 </p>
